  "description": "<p>It appears that an untranslated URI is appearing in the response: <b>ns001:describes          &lt;fedora:uribase/versioned_resource&gt; ;</b></p>\n\n<p>Also it is not clear why the iana prefix is not used since it should be a built in prefix.</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>To reproduce: </p>\n\n<p>1.create a versioned resource with a memento:</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n \r\n#create binary resource\r\ncurl -i -XPOST  -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Slug: versioned_resource\"</span> -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Link: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource&gt;; rel=\\\"</span>type\\<span class=\"code-quote\">\"\" \"</span>http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span><span class=\"code-quote\">\" -H \"</span>Content-Type: text/plain<span class=\"code-quote\">\" --data-binary \"</span>Test\";\r\n</span>#create memento:\r\ncurl -v -X POST  <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource/fcr:versions\"</span></span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>2. retrieve the description memento: </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -X GET http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/&lt;memento&gt;</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>3. confirm two triples in the response: </p>\n\n<p><b>ns001:describes          &lt;fedora:uribase/versioned_resource&gt; ;</b></p>\n\n<p>and</p>\n\n<p><b>ns001:describes          &lt;<a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource</a>&gt; .</b></p>\n\n<p><b>(full response)</b></p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource&gt;\r\n</span> rdf:type ldp:NonRDFSource ;\r\n rdf:type fedora:NonRdfSourceDescription ;\r\n rdf:type fedora:Binary ;\r\n rdf:type fedora:Resource ;\r\n ns001:describes &lt;fedora:uribase/versioned_resource&gt; ;\r\n fedora:created <span class=\"code-quote\">\"2018-05-04T21:47:02.192Z\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\r\n</span> fedora:writable <span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span> ;\r\n premis:hasSize <span class=\"code-quote\">\"4\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#<span class=\"code-object\">long</span>&gt; ;\r\n</span> ebucore:hasMimeType <span class=\"code-quote\">\"text/plain\"</span> ;\r\n fedora:lastModified <span class=\"code-quote\">\"2018-05-04T21:47:02.192Z\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\r\n</span> premis:hasMessageDigest &lt;urn:sha1:640ab2bae07bedc4c163f679a746f7ab7fb5d1fa&gt; ;\r\n ebucore:filename \"\" ;\r\n fedora:lastModifiedBy <span class=\"code-quote\">\"bypassAdmin\"</span> ;\r\n fedora:createdBy <span class=\"code-quote\">\"bypassAdmin\"</span> ;\r\n rdf:type ldp:NonRDFSource ;\r\n fedora:writable <span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span> ;\r\n ns001:describes &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource&gt; .</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p> </p>",
